    "identifier": "lotus-anxious-petals",
    "description": "<p>You grasp a hand full of poisonous Lotus petals, spreading them in a unique way. Select a space you can within range as you fill a 10-foot cube with a petal dance of revulsion. A creature who’s failed this jutsu’s save once before, cannot be affected again for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>As they flutter in front of you, all creatures within range must make a Charisma saving throw to as the pollen begins to affect their emotional state.</p>",
